# V1 release runbook (2026-11-02), Phase 6: abandoned PNG-conversion experiment output (95M,
# regeneratable from scripts/experiment-extract-embedded-png.ts) -- the conversion itself was
# reverted (commit c9a3ca8, approval withdrawn), kept on disk only as a resumable starting
# point if the owner re-approves that work; never committed, same convention as the two lines
# above.
/assets/_png_experiment/

# Build 22: generated SQL/JSON derived from real, read-only production queries -- real user
# UUIDs, real historical quiz/Daily answers. Never committed to this public repository.
# Regenerate locally from scripts/backfill-*.ts / scripts/generate-*.ts against a fresh
# read-only query any time it's needed; tracked tests use synthetic fixtures only (see
# scripts/validate-*.ts and scripts/pglite-harness/, none of which embed real user data).
/scripts/generated-sql-for-approval/
*.real-data.json
*.real-data.sql
